          "time": "2026-09-23T00:51:32+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Barkin: It is tempting to blame high inflation on a handful of categories exposed to energy costs or tariffs, but much of the personal consumption expenditures index is rising by more than 3%."
